# aros-startup-markers
#
# Numbered progress markers around every startup and shutdown step, printed with an immediate flush, for locating a call that never returns - backlog item 21. Also a 'no-audio' file next to the binary that skips OpenAL initialisation entirely rather than muting it, so the two can be compared; a file and not an environment variable because the AROS Shell's setenv does not reach posixc's getenv(). Diagnostic scaffolding, NOT for upstream: remove it once item 21 is closed.
#
# Against OpenLoco af445f8dc6632c6341fc7b26c3246685406e6815, applied with -p1 by scripts/bootstrap.sh.
# Saved 2026-09-18.

